OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACrossbow-wielding arsonist not
OL,4,Aguilty due to insanity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crossbow-wielding arsonist who
OL,7,Ftargeted an Indian restaurant and 5G
OL,8,Fmasts in a three-week campaign has been
OL,9,Ffound not guilty by a jury by reason of
OL,10,Finsanity.
OL,12,FMilo Creese, 40, also fired a 15cm
OL,13,Fcrossbow bolt through a woman's window
OL,14,Fand assaulted two police officers as
OL,15,Fthey tried to arrest him in Surrey, the
OL,16,FOld Bailey heard.
OL,18,FProsecutor Lyndon Harris said Creese
OL,19,Fwas motivated by terrorism and an
OL,20,Fextreme hatred of Muslims, believing
OL,21,Fthat some alleged Islamic atrocities
OL,22,Fwere linked to 5G masts.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
