OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a jury found Creese not guilty to
OL,7,Fcharges of arson with intent to
OL,8,Fendanger life, arson, damaging
OL,9,Fproperty, having an offensive weapon in
OL,10,Fpublic and two assaults on an emergency
OL,11,Fworker.
